      "evidence_points": "The CVE description states that after commit cc0cc23babc9, `xive_irq_free_data()` used `irq_get_chip_data()` looking up data through the child domain, while the XIVE-specific data is associated with the XIVE (parent) domain; the patch fixes this by passing the `domain` pointer to `xive_irq_free_data()` and using `irq_domain_get_irq_data(domain, virq)` to access the correct parent domain data."
